results/eta_results_hpc_pool*/
results/eta_results_smoke*/
results/eta_results/*.png
*-out-*.[0-9]*
*-err-*.[0-9]*

# Model checkpoints: only the four best-validation teaser checkpoints of Fig. 3 are released
*.pth
!resnet_teaser/checkpoints/TEASER_T0_RED_REAL_L5_bc15.pth.best.pth
!resnet_teaser/checkpoints/TEASER_T0_RED_REAL_L5_mse.pth.best.pth
